    "detailed_description": "Ashley is a <strong>brave little bird</strong>. Following the call of one of her old friends, she returns to her native kingdom, the Immortal Shadow Lands. She discovers that this world is <strong>invaded by glitched and weird monsters </strong>, the <strong>anomalies</strong>, created by a mysterious Scarlet Ghost.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266400/extras/1b83f598ae426e61bd12929a8fd6d92a.avif?t=1723662903\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266400/extras/2ff07f9e7fc123ca26afa95cdd5b82bf.avif?t=1723662903\" /></span><br><strong>Ashley</strong> and her friend <strong>Poe</strong>, take the initiative of <strong>ridding this world of what gnaws at it</strong> at the request of the king himself. But who knows what <strong>dark secrets</strong> are hidden by Poe, the Scarlet Ghost, the origins of the anomalies and the kingdom or Ash herself? Our little bird, in this adventure, will never be <strong>at the end of its surprises</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266400/extras/1b83f598ae426e61bd12929a8fd6d92a.avif?t=1723662903\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266400/extras/41ef4cde21332cb7f6afc39737bef574.avif?t=1723662903\" /></span><br>Inspired by the <strong>fabulous work</strong> of Team Cherry on their masterpiece, <strong>Hollow Knight</strong>, this game will test its player in an adventure through <strong>the many territories</strong> that compose the world that offers itself in a totally open way in this <strong>platformer metroidvania</strong>. So what are you waiting for to <strong>try your luck</strong>?",
